<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <!--
    The shockwave ring a space Breach Burn leaves at its launch cell, fired by
    SCWC_BreachJumpBlastOff from Ability_BreachJump.Cast. Built on Core's impact-wave recipe
    (ShockwaveFast, the Anomaly pit gate's emergence ring): a black quad on the
    MoteLargeDistortionWave shader, which sweeps a ring of background distortion outward
    over the fleck's age (Graphic_FleckPulse feeds it AgeSecs), masked by the
    PsychicDistortionCurrents torus and PsycastNoise. Biotech's mech-band stun shockwave is
    the same recipe at pawn-event scale. Chosen 2026-09-18 over the first version, a
    FleckGlowDistortBackground disc on the PsycastDistortionMask ripple texture (Core's
    psycast area ring, scaled fast): that one read as a psycast, this one as an impact.
    Everything referenced here is Core-owned, so no DLC is needed: the shaderType, the three
    textures and FleckBase; Core's own ShockwaveFast uses them all.

    Sizing: a fleck's width is drawSize x (1 + growthRate x age), and the shader's ring runs
    within that quad (its sweep timing is compiled into the shader and was tuned by eye).
    growthRate 1.5 is the value every vanilla instance of this recipe uses, so drawSize sets
    the size: 2.4 over 0.32 s ends at 3.6 cells across, a thruster-sized snap at the origin,
    less than half the landing ring (BreachLandingShockwave.xml). _distortionIntensity 0.05
    is the low end of the range shipped for THIS shader (mech-band 0.066, ShockwaveFast 0.2
    for a screen-filling map event); the number means something else under other shaders.
    MoteOverheadLow, as the mech-band ring: draws over pawns, so the wave visibly passes
    across the squadmates standing at the launch cell. drawOffscreen true so the sprayer
    still spawns it with the camera elsewhere; a one-shot fleck, so it costs nothing.
  -->
  <FleckDef ParentName="FleckBase">
    <defName>SCWC_BreachJumpShockwave</defName>
    <altitudeLayer>MoteOverheadLow</altitudeLayer>
    <fadeInTime>0.02</fadeInTime>
    <solidTime>0.20</solidTime>
    <fadeOutTime>0.10</fadeOutTime>
    <growthRate>1.5</growthRate>
    <drawOffscreen>true</drawOffscreen>
    <graphicData>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_FleckPulse</graphicClass>
      <texPath>Things/Mote/Black</texPath>
      <shaderType>MoteLargeDistortionWave</shaderType>
      <shaderParameters>
        <_DistortionTex>/Things/Mote/PsychicDistortionCurrents</_DistortionTex>
        <_NoiseTex>/Things/Mote/PsycastNoise</_NoiseTex>
        <_distortionIntensity>0.05</_distortionIntensity>
        <_brightnessMultiplier>1.15</_brightnessMultiplier>
      </shaderParameters>
      <drawSize>2.4</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
  </FleckDef>
</Defs>
